   "zh": "网格序列 · Mesh4D",
   "en": "Mesh Sequence · Mesh4D"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "给一段单目 RGB 画面，Mesh4D 前馈生成一个完整的三维动画网格和它的形变。这张卡用 BiRefNet 抠出主体，交付整段拓扑不变的几何缓存 USD。仅限研究。",
   "en": "Given monocular RGB footage, Mesh4D generates a complete animated 3D mesh and its deformation feed-forward. This card mattes the subject with BiRefNet and delivers a geometry cache USD with constant topology for the whole shot. Research only."
  },
